{"slug":"An-Average-Campaign-Alpha-v0.3-Unlock-Recipes-75036","_id":"693ef802d5a0b2bcf1a884e1","title":"Unlock Recipes","game":{"_id":"691b986419c74460e65eed65","gameId":80734098185936,"name":"An Average Campaign [Alpha v0.5.0]","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-9015a459882eef1fca3bf48261badc37-8f48127da68c.png","placeId":80734098185936},"features":"Will unlock all recipes in the game, again this will grant no advantage and again is just visual. Yet as long as you have the resources for the recipe you can craft it. I'll look into seeing if there is anything I can do for spoofing recipe costs or shop prices next.","tags":["script","ui","cheat","hack","mod"],"script":"-- leaving open source cause it's not anything crazy im just accessing the module and taking information out of it. \n\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal Items = require(ReplicatedStorage.Dictionaries.Items)\n\nif not Items[\"Rat Hide\"] then\n\twarn(\"Rat Hide does not exist in Items dictionary\")\n\treturn\nend\n\nlocal allRecipes = {}\n\nfor itemName, itemData in pairs(Items) do\n\tif typeof(itemData) == \"table\" and itemData.Recipe then\n\t\ttable.insert(allRecipes, itemName)\n\tend\nend\n\nItems[\"Rat Hide\"].UnlocksRecipe = allRecipes\nprint(\"Unlocked\", #allRecipes, \"recipes\")","owner":{"_id":"69164ce7c0d28d47379ac5cb","username":"sinsly","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/69164ce7c0d28d47379ac5cb-1771904278305.jpg","status":"offline","id":"69164ce7c0d28d47379ac5cb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":7302,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/80734098185936-1765734402665.png","likeCount":7,"dislikeCount":3,"createdAt":"2025-12-14T17:46:42.694Z","keyLink":"","executes":481,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"693ef802d5a0b2bcf1a884e3","editBy":{"_id":"69164ce7c0d28d47379ac5cb","user